{"event": "result", "result": {"conversation_id": "a87a2eba-e4c7-49ad-a1ef-ca2af60ce637", "status": "ERROR", "response": "I have created [`/app/filter.py`](file:///app/filter.py) to remove JavaScript and prevent XSS attacks while preserving all legitimate HTML structure, standard formatting, non-dangerous attributes, and elements.\n\n### Key Implementation Details\n- **Command-line Interface**: Accepts an HTML file path as `sys.argv[1]` and updates the file in-place.\n- **Formatting Preservation**: Operates directly on character slices rather than re-serializing a DOM tree, ensuring line breaks, spacing, quotes, unquoted attributes, and non-dangerous elements remain byte-for-byte identical.\n- **JavaScript & XSS Filtering**:\n  - Removes `<script>` tags and their contents (including self-closing script tags and case/whitespace variations).\n  - Strips inline event handlers (`on...` attributes) from HTML tags while preserving non-dangerous attributes and tag spacing.\n  - Strips attributes containing `javascript:`, `vbscript:`, or non-media `data:` URIs (handling HTML entity decoding and control character stripping).\n  - Cleans CSS expressions or inline scripts within `<style>` tags or `style` attributes.\n  - Mitigates script execution vectors across `<iframe srcdoc=\"...\">`, SVG script tags, and `<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\">` tags.\n", "error": "API error (attempt 5): RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED (code 429): Resource exhausted. Please try again later. Please refer to https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/error-code-429 for more details.", "duration_seconds": 362.978236422, "num_turns": 1, "usage": {"input_tokens": 138556, "output_tokens": 45849, "thinking_tokens": 33950, "cache_read_tokens": 376885, "total_tokens": 184405}}}